Bind Npc 24439 Zone 11 for karus
Bind Npc 14439 Zone 12 for elmorad
Quest 276 "The Ominous Force"
    Repeat always
    Journal for karus "You will receive 2,500,000 EXP for hunting 20 Troll Magicians, and 5,500,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given if you are 75Lv or higher)."
    Journal for elmorad "You will receive 2,500,000 EXP for hunting 100 Troll Magicians, and 5,500,000 EXP if you have Premium (But, the reward will not be given if you are 75Lv or higher)."
    Kill 20 of 8054, 8004

Requires player level >= 60 and player level <= 74

Rewards
    Give 2500000 experience or 5500000 with premium

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Such an ominous and heavy force...? It's them... It must be them."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "The power of their sorcery... As this evil energy melts into your body, it drags your soul down into an endless hell."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Such an ominous and heavy force...? It's them... It must be them."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It's the power of their sorcery... As the evil energy melts into your body, it drags your soul down into an endless hell.\n\nIt's a Troll Shaman\nNobody emits evil force like they do! If the evil force is allowed to spread, all Eslant will be hell-bound to damnation. But why do I feel such peace as soon as I see you??"

On ready
    Say "It was a hard fight, Master-"
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Have I ever told you that I found peace because of you? Hmm..."
